 <h3><u>Koi nahi hussain ka</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka</p> 
  <p>Hungaam-e-Asr Ka (Manzar Hai)..(2)<br> Na Ghazi Na Koi (Lashkar Hai)..(2)</p> 
  <p>Wa Ghurbataa (Ayi Wa Ghurbata)..(2)</p> 
  <p>(Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beganey Dais Main)..(2)<br> (Hal Min ki Hai Sada)..(2)x Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka<br> (Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beygane Dais Main)..(2)</p> 
  <p>Hai Asr Ka Samaa Rota Hai Aasmaan<br> Hai Aakhri Azaan Gham Sey Hai Neem Jaan<br> Hussain&nbsp; Ya Hussain<br> Hussain&nbsp; Badshah<br> Akela Reh Gaya<br> Wo Ghar Luta Chuka<br> Bacha Key Dee'n Tera<br> Khuda Ay Khuda Ay Khuda Ay Khuda<br> (Kunba Ujad Gaya)..(2) Beygane Dais Main<br> Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beygane Dais Main<br> (Halmin Ki Hai Sada)..(2) Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka<br> (Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beygane Dais Main)..(2)</p> 
  <p>Laashey Uthha Chuka Ghar Bhi Luta Chuka<br> Har Aik Laash Per Aansu Baha Chuka<br> Hussain&nbsp; Ya Hussain<br> Hussain&nbsp; Badshah<br> Akela Reh Gaya<br> Wo Ghar Luta Chuka<br> Bacha Key Dee'n Tera<br> Khuda Ay Khuda Ay Khuda Ay Khuda<br> (Rota Hai Zuljanah)..(2) Beygane Dais Main<br> Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beygane Dais Main<br> (Halmin Ki Hai Sada)..(2) Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka<br> (Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beygane Dais Main)..(2)</p> 
  <p>Laakho'n Main Ghir Gaya Mazloom-e-Karbala<br> Dey Kis Ko Ab Sada Ghazi To So Gaya<br> Hussain&nbsp; Ya Hussain<br> Hussain&nbsp; Badshah<br> Akela Reh Gaya<br> Wo Ghar Luta Chuka<br> Bacha Key Dee'n Tera<br> Khuda Ay Khuda Ay Khuda Ay Khuda<br> (Lashkar Bichhad Gaya)..(2) Beygane Dais Main<br> Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beygane Dais Main<br> (Halmin Ki Hai Sada)..(2) Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka<br> (Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beygane Dais Main)..(2)</p> 
  <p>Zainab Ki Thi Sada Aye Wa Musibataa<br> Nana Tera Hussain&nbsp; Ghorey Se Gir Gaya<br> Hussain Ya Hussain<br> Hussain Badshah<br> Akela Reh Gaya<br> Wo Ghar Luta Chuka<br> Bacha Key Dee'n Tera<br> Khuda Ay Khuda Ay Khuda Ay Khuda<br> (Zainab Ki Thi Sada)..(2) Beygane Dais Main<br> Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beygane Dais Main<br> (Halmin Ki Hai Sada)..(2) Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka<br> Koi Nahi Hussain&nbsp; Ka Beygane Dais Main</p> 
  <p>Wa Ghurbata (Ayi Wa Ghurbata)..3</p> 
